WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.863
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.720
- Money makes the world go round,

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.050
but managing it can make our head spin.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:13.050
So here's some smart advice
from someone we love.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.000
- Hi Drew, I'm Farnoosh and
here's today's Money Moment.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.520
Saving money is important
ow more than ever,

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.810
and shoring up cash can be as simple

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.980
as making a few phone calls.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.510
The trick is to be proactive.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.610
The savings won't arrive on your doorstep.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.320
You need to make the call.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.980
For example, credit card companies

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.480
are reducing interest rates,

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.990
eliminating fees, and
allowing some customers

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.840
to defer monthly payments.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.190
Just dial the 800 number
on the back of your card

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:41.600
and ask about any and all
types of financial relief.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.470
Your cable company could
also drop your rate,

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.120
especially with so much
competition out there.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.020
They don't want to lose your business.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.767
Simply asking customer service,

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.930
"How can I save on my
cable bill this month?"

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.550
could lead to discounts and deals,

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.160
maybe even a free
month's worth of service.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.910
Finally, if you're driving
your car less these days,

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:00.950
then you probably shouldn't
be paying the same

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.340
for car insurance.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.410
And while some companies

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:06.230
are automatically reducing
bills for customers,

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.840
you may wanna call and confirm.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.900
You could save as much as 15% a month.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.558
- Gosh, that makes so much sense.

00:01:13.558 --> 00:01:16.141
(upbeat music)

